<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Handwritten Math Notes</title>
    <script src="https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6"></script>
    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zhi+Mang+Xing&family=Liu+Jian+Mao+Cao&display=swap');

        body {
            background-color: #f0ebe1;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .notebook-container {
            width: 750px;
            background-color: #f7f3ec;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 3px 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            /* Simulating notebook grid lines */
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(to right, transparent 80px, #b0b0b0 80px, #b0b0b0 81px, transparent 81px), /* Vertical margin line */
                linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 29px, #e0dcd2 29px, #e0dcd2 30px, transparent 30px), /* Horizontal grid */
                linear-gradient(to right, transparent 29px, #e0dcd2 29px, #e0dcd2 30px, transparent 30px);  /* Vertical grid */
            background-size: 100% 100%, 30px 30px, 30px 30px;
            background-position: 0 0, 0 45px, 20px 0;
            padding: 50px 30px 60px 95px; /* Adjust padding to align text with grid */
            box-sizing: border-box;

            /* Text Styling */
            font-family: 'Liu Jian Mao Cao', 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', cursive, serif;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #4a53a0; /* Pen blue */
            line-height: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Faint top pre-printed text */
        .header-faint {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 25px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #a0a0a0;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .red-pen { color: #d93838; }
        .orange-pen { color: #e67d22; }
        .green-pen { color: #27ae60; }

        .flex-row {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            justify-content: space-around;
            margin-top: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .math-column {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 45%;
        }

        .arrow-down {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: -5px;
        }

        .placeholder {
            border: 2px dashed #4a53a0;
            background-color: rgba(74, 83, 160, 0.05);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            color: #4a53a0;
        }

        .placeholder.red-placeholder {
            border-color: #d93838;
            background-color: rgba(217, 56, 56, 0.05);
            color: #d93838;
        }

        .title-large {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .line-block {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 5px; /* fine tuning to stay on grid */
        }

        .margin-left-lg { margin-left: 25px; }
        .margin-left-xl { margin-left: 50px; }

        /* MathJax adjustments for inline flow */
        mjx-container[jax="CHTML"][display="true"] {
            display: inline-block !important;
            margin: 0 !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="notebook-container">
    <div class="header-faint">Keywords 关键词 &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; Notes 笔记</div>

    <div class="line-block">
        2. 再定轴: 括号内取0(顶点式); $x=-\frac{b}{2a}$(一般式)
    </div>

    <div class="flex-row">
        <div class="math-column">
            <div class="arrow-down">&darr;</div>
            <div>$y = -2(x+1)^2-3$</div>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 120px; height: 100px; margin-top: 15px;">
                [Diagram: Parabola<br>opening downwards]
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="math-column">
            <div class="arrow-down">&darr;</div>
            <div>$y = 2x^2-3x+3$</div>
            <div class="placeholder" style="width: 120px; height: 100px; margin-top: 15px;">
                [Diagram: Parabola<br>opening upwards]
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="title-large">
        <span class="red-pen">例</span><span class="orange-pen">题</span><span class="green-pen">精</span><span class="orange-pen">讲</span>
    </div>

    <div class="line-block">
        例1 (1) 2020 福建厦门中考
    </div>

    <div class="line-block">
        由二次函数 $y=2(x-3)^2+1$，可知 (<span class="red-pen">B</span>)
    </div>

    <div class="line-block margin-left-lg">
        A. 其图象的开口向下. &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red-pen">&times; &nbsp; $a=2>0$ 向上</span>
    </div>

    <div class="line-block margin-left-lg">
        B. 其图象的顶点坐标为 $(3, 1)$ &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red-pen">&check; &nbsp; 对=3 $(3,1)$</span>
    </div>

    <div class="line-block margin-left-lg">
        C. 其图象的对称轴为直线 $x=-3$. &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red-pen">&times;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="line-block margin-left-lg" style="position: relative;">
        D. 当 $x<3$ 时, $y$ 随 $x$ 的增大而增大. &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red-pen">&times;</span>
        <div class="red-pen" style="position: absolute; left: 350px; top: 25px;">减小</div>
        <div class="placeholder red-placeholder" style="position: absolute; right: 20px; top: -10px; width: 60px; height: 70px;">
            [Diagram:<br>Parabola<br>opening up]
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="line-block" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        例1 (2)
    </div>

    <div class="line-block">
        对于二次函数 $y=x^2-2x-1$, 下列说法不正确的是(<span class="red-pen">D</span>)
    </div>

    <div class="line-block margin-left-lg">
        A. 函数图象的对称轴是直线 $x=1$ &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red-pen">对=$-\frac{-2}{2\times1}=1$</span>
    </div>

    <div class="line-block margin-left-lg" style="position: relative;">
        B. 函数图象的顶点坐标为 $(1, -2)$ &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="red-pen">$(1,-2)$</span>
        <div class="red-pen" style="position: absolute; right: 0; top: 30px; text-align: right; width: 100%;">
            当$x=1$时, $y=1-2-1=-2$
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
